text":"母のお下がりです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一気に大人の階段のぼった。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前までのお財布は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIZLISAのピンクベージュの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIZLISAにしては大人っぽいかな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなにラブリーじゃないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも可愛らしい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さめの分厚めの二つ折り財布！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学の入学祝いに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母からのプレゼントでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かれこれ5年くらい使ってるんだな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも物持ち良い方だから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切れたり擦れたりしてないの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色は変わってきてる気がするけど(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生で初めての長財布！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"薄いね！あとお札入れるの便利！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早速、野口さんが入りました( ･⊝･ )♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一回修理に出してあるらしく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きれいだし、大事に使うぞ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、ここだけの話、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二十歳になったら母に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お給料でお財布買ってあげるんだ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学入学祝いにもらった時からずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう決めてたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いらないと言われてもあげます(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポイントカードはね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コスメストア、本屋さん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服屋さん、コンビニ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑貨屋さん、靴下屋さん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パン屋さん、定食屋さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポイントカードが入ってるよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多い方なのか、どうなのか(°_°)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネーカード？は一切持ってません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポイントは貯める派です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店員さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「使いますか？」と聞かれたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使うタイプです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞かれないと永遠に溜まっていく(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上私のお財布事情でした～(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはお財布"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなの使ってるのかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カード多めとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レシート溜まってるとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その人らしさが出るよね(  ´ω`  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうそう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに聞きたいことが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構前の、\nまだ研究生リレーブログのとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢アイドルや乃木坂に興味を持った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初のきっかけは？｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というような質問、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人ブログになったら答えるねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったままだったんです(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、